<Layout title="About Burrito" description="Burrito is an artist and event collective founded by artists. We organize exhibitions, group releases, open calls, and artist interviews."><PageIntro eyebrow="About Burrito" title="For artists. By artists." text="Burrito started with friends who met through online art communities." /><section class="wrap page-content"><p class="about-statement">We organize exhibitions, release work together, and help artists meet each other.</p><div class="reading-layout" style="border:0"><p class="eyebrow">Since 2021</p><div class="prose"><p>We’re artists ourselves. Burrito grew out of the conversations and friendships we were already having online. We wanted more ways to show work together and meet in person.</p><p>Since then, we’ve held events in New York, Miami, Denver, Chicago, and Paris. Some started with an open call. Others brought together a group release, a gallery show, or a live art session.</p><p>Our recent projects include Return to Form, the Dérailler street photography exhibition in Paris, and an MTG draft with artist-designed cards at Lume Studios.</p><a class="text-link" href="/exhibitions/">Browse the exhibitions ↗</a></div></div><div class="section-heading"><h2>What we do</h2></div><div class="service-list">{services.map(([title,text],i)=><article class="service-row"><span>0{i+1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div><div class="reading-layout" style="margin-top:60px;border:0"><p class="eyebrow">The collective</p><div class="prose"><p>Meet the people organizing and contributing to Burrito, with links to their own work.</p><a class="text-link" href="/team/">Meet the team ↗</a><p>We’ve worked with Lume Studios, collect.rip, Le Grand Jeu, Rarible, and the RARI Foundation community, among others. If you’d like to host a show or collaborate on a project, get in touch.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Contact Burrito ↗</a></div></div></section></Layout>
